path="solicitar-soporte" href="#">Solicitar Soporte</a><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-[18px]">person</span></div></div></div></header><main class="w-full pt-20 bg-background"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-low/60 via-background to-background py-space-xl">
<!-- Ambient Tech Glow Orbs -->
<div class="absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[720px] h-[340px] bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-fixed/50 via-secondary-container/20 to-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-48 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-fixed-dim/30 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
<!-- Text Column -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start gap-space-md">
<!-- Trust Badge -->
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
<span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-container animate-pulse"></span>
<span class="font-code-spec text-code-spec text-primary tracking-wider uppercase">SERVICIO TÉCNICO &amp; SEGURIDAD ELECTRÓNICA | +20 AÑOS</span>
</div>
<!-- Main Headline -->
<h1 class="font-headline-2xl text-headline-2xl text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight">
            Expertos en devolverle la vida a tu
            <span class="relative inline-block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-container">
              tecnología.
              <span class="absolute left-0 -bottom-1 w-full h-1.5 bg-secondary-container rounded-full opacity-80"></span>
</span>
</h1>
<!-- Subtitle -->
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Servicio técnico especializado, mantenimiento y venta de equipos informáticos con más de 20 años de experiencia. Trae tu equipo a nuestras instalaciones para un diagnóstico profesional o explora nuestros productos disponibles.
          </p>
<!-- CTA Buttons -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md pt-space-xs">
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-lg py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all" data-path="catalogo-de-equipos" href="#">
