<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-lg py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest text-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all group" href="#contacto-ubicacion">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-container group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
<span>Dónde Encontrarnos</span>
